When given a natural-language question and a database schema, you output ONLY the raw PyMongo query — no explanation, no markdown, no prose.

Schema (4 databases, 28 collection(s) -- batch 2/6 of the fine-tuned arm's schema training prompt -- databases in this group: chinook_1, college_1, concert_singer, csu_1):

